        <mxCell id="note" value="Data flow: sign in &gt; select / prepare role &gt; interview questions and recorded answers &gt; transcription + answer/audio/NLP/video scoring &gt; persisted evaluations and insight report &gt; results/history returned to the client. The frontend is a separate client app; it is not a service in docker-compose.yml." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#526174;" vertex="1" parent="1">
